# Flo 2026 Mock Data Standards

## Scale (realistic, not theoretical)
- Venue: Nagarro Gurgaon Office (~90 spaces, Ground + 6th-13th floors)
- 3 days (Day 1–3), 09:00–17:00
- Slots: 09, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16 (12:00 cafeteria lightning talks only)
- ~650 sessions total (not every room active every slot)
- ~80 speakers: curated C-suite roster + generated ICs
- 10 tracks, 10 formats

## Speaker title tiers (software services)
- Tier 1: Chairman, CEO, CTO, COO, CFO, CPO
- Tier 2: Chief Delivery Officer, Global Practice Heads, Chief Architect, VPs
- Tier 3: Unit Heads, Practice Heads, Distinguished Engineer, Principal Architect
- Tier 4: Senior Director, Engineering Manager, Lead Consultant, Solution Architect

## Session fields (required)
id, title, abstract, day, startTime, endTime, venueId, trackId,
speakerIds[], tags[], format, level, featured (bool), capacity,
building (always "Nagarro Gurgaon Office")

## Integrity rules (generator MUST enforce)
- Every speakerId, venueId, trackId resolves to a record
- No speaker appears in 2 rooms at the same startTime
- Session capacity <= venue capacity
- 12:00 slot is cafeteria-only lightning talks (`ven-C601`)
- Every venue includes `wing` (`N`, `S`, `central`) and wing matches venue id convention
- featured=true only on curated demo list (see plan)

## No PII
- Speakers are fictional; no real Nagarro employees
- No real attendee data anywhere
